  "notes": "Åland runs its own Swedish-language schools under 2020:32, apart from Finland's law. Läroplikt starts in the autumn term of the year a child turns 7; the förundervisning year before is left out. Grundskolan is nine years: municipal lågstadieskolor teach årskurs 1–6 and högstadieskolor 7–9. Ålands lyceum's general upper secondary is 150 study points over three årskurser (up to four) ending in Finland's studentexamen; Ålands yrkesgymnasium is the vocational route. Names for the gymnasium years (första året, ettan) are everyday usage, not from the cited pages."
